  randomFlavorTexts:
  - Alduin spews out curving fireballs that {mc} tries to block with his shield.
  - Alduin slashes his claws at {mc}, which he tries to block.
  - Alduin surrounds {mc} with smaller fireballs that need to be blocked.
  - Alduin breathes out three beams of fire.
  - Alduin surrounds {mc} with smaller fireballs that need to be avoided.
  - Alduin drags colored fire toward {mc}.
  - Alduin pins {mc} and attempts to burn him with fire breath.
  - Alduin tries to bite {mc}.
  - Alduin curves his fire breath to try to hit {mc}.
  - Alduin rains down fire from above.
  - Alduin breathes concrentrated fire at {mc}, which he tries to block.
  - Alduin rapidly breaths multiple pillars of fire, in an attempt to singe {mc}
    with them.
  - Alduin temporarily takes flight to breath fire from around {mc}.
  - Alduin fires orange fire at {mc}.
  - Alduin fires blue fire at {mc}.
  maxHealth: 400
